# DESK33, step 1 of the fixture: let the desktop write its own NEWDESK.INF, so
# the `#G` association line the F-key test needs can be APPENDED to a file our
# own writer produced rather than hand-crafted whole.
#
# Options title hover (196,9), "Save desktop..." click (280,187) -- both from
# the probe run's [probe] menu dump.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
2700 move 196 240
2900 move 196 9
3400 move 280 187
3800 down
4000 up
4400 parkbr
5600 mark B_SAVED
